RESOLUTION NO.
Approved a to
form
ENTITLED: A RESOLUTION AUTHORIZING A STREET NAME CHANGE FROM
“PRAIRIE AVENUE” TO “SHORT ROAD” FOR THE PORTION OF THE
STREET LOCATED BETWEEN DELL RANGE BOULEVARD AND THE
UNDEVELOPED SECTION OF PRAIRIE AVENUE, CITY OF CHEYENNE,
LARAMIE COUNTY, WYOMING
WHEREAS, the one block segment of Prairie Avenue between Dell Range and the
undeveloped section of Prairie Avenue as shown on the Exhibit Map attached hereto creates
duplicate intersection names of “Dell Range Boulevard and Prairie Avenue;” and
WHEREAS, having duplicate intersection names creates confusion for emergency medical,
fire, rescue and police personnel responding to the area; and
WHEREAS, the Laramie County Combined Communications Center has requested, and
the Geographic Information System has proposed, this section of Prairie Avenue be renamed from
“Prairie Avenue” to “Short Road” to eliminate the duplicate intersection names;
NOW, THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, THAT the requested street name change from “Prairie
Avenue” to “Short Road” for the portion of the street between Dell Range Boulevard and the
undeveloped section ofPrairie Avenue, is hereby approved and the City Engineer or her designated
representative is directed to change the City of Cheyenne Official Map.
DAY OF
PRESENTED, READ, AND ADOPTED THIS
(SEAL)
AflEST:
201$.
MARIAN J. ORR, MAYOR
CAROL INTLEKOFER, CITY CLERK
